Created [CWD]/mojo/example-mojo (MojoJvm) for pad
  port.mojo
  .gitignore
  README.md
  mojo-anything.json
  pixi.toml
  json.mojo
  dispatcher.mojo
  java/mojoanything/ExampleMojoNative.java
  java/mojoanything/MojoAnythingJson.java
  java/mojoanything/MojoAnythingError.java
  java/com/example/Names.java
- Port each function in port.mojo, then: mojo-anything record [CWD]/mojo/example-mojo && mojo-anything build [CWD]/mojo/example-mojo && mojo-anything diff [CWD]/mojo/example-mojo
- Callers compile the classes in java/ and load the library `build` writes (system property mojo-anything.lib.<name>, MOJO_ANYTHING_LIB, or next to the classes); run the JVM with --enable-native-access=ALL-UNNAMED (Java 22+).
